After throwing the cookie into Cyberchef I was able to decode the first part 
eyJ1c2VyX2lkIjozLCJ1c2VybmFtZSI6InNhcmFoLmpvaG5zb24iLCJyb2xlIjoidXNlciJ9 = {"user_id":3,"username":"sarah.johnson","role":"user"}
