eyJ1c2VyX2lkIjoxLCJ1c2VybmFtZSI6ImxhdXJhLmhheWVzIiwicm9sZSI6ImFkbWlufQ== = {"user_id":1,"username":"laura.hayes","role":"admin}
This would make our new value eyJ1c2VyX2lkIjoxLCJ1c2VybmFtZSI6ImxhdXJhLmhheWVzIiwicm9sZSI6ImFkbWlufQ==.0bceab2ebd4da65aefd97d6b1c7a2f3a8fa71d6ee3882cc44b8d97937a5fc49d
